                <pb facs="0723" n="635" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg635"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Scruggs to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-10-18"><hi rendition="#italic">October 18,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Scruggs reports that he will fulfill the formalities of recognition in a few
                    days, and that it is expected the representatives of other powers will
                    follow.</p>
            </div>
